  <ProjectItem type="NClass.DiagramEditor.ClassDiagram.Diagram" assembly="NClass.DiagramEditor, Version=2.4.1823.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null">
    <Name>MarketData_Sequences</Name>
    <Language>CSharp</Language>
    <Entities>
      <Entity type="Comment">
        <Text>Сценарий 1: LoadHistory (REST)</Text>
        <Location left="34" top="299" />
        <Size width="190" height="50" />
      </Entity>
      <Entity type="Comment">
        <Text>MainWindow.onLoadClicked()</Text>
        <Location left="31" top="424" />
        <Size width="176" height="50" />
      </Entity>
      <Entity type="Comment">
        <Text>вызывает MarketDataService.loadHistory(symbol, tf)</Text>
        <Location left="234" top="424" />
        <Size width="227" height="50" />
      </Entity>
      <Entity type="Comment">
        <Text>MarketDataService вызывает exchange.fetchKlines(symbol, tf)</Text>
        <Location left="489" top="424" />
        <Size width="185" height="50" />
      </Entity>
      <Entity type="Comment">
        <Text>exchange возвращает List&lt;Candle&gt;</Text>
        <Location left="702" top="424" />
        <Size width="202" height="50" />
      </Entity>
      <Entity type="Comment">
        <Text>MarketDataService создаёт/обновляет currentSeries (CandleSeries)</Text>
        <Location left="933" top="424" />
        <Size width="220" height="50" />
      </Entity>
      <Entity type="Comment">
        <Text>MarketDataService уведомляет UI: seriesLoaded(currentSeries) (сигнал/коллбек)</Text>
        <Location left="1183" top="424" />
        <Size width="253" height="50" />
      </Entity>
      <Entity type="Comment">
        <Text>Сценарий 2: Realtime (WS)</Text>
        <Location left="34" top="669" />
        <Size width="171" height="50" />
      </Entity>
      <Entity type="Comment">
        <Text>MainWindow включает realtime</Text>
        <Location left="34" top="779" />
        <Size width="189" height="50" />
      </Entity>
      <Entity type="Comment">
        <Text>вызывает MarketDataService.startRealtime()</Text>
        <Location left="249" top="779" />
        <Size width="194" height="50" />
      </Entity>
      <Entity type="Comment">
        <Text>MarketDataService вызывает exchange.subscribeKlines(symbol, tf)</Text>
        <Location left="701" top="779" />
        <Size width="206" height="50" />
      </Entity>
      <Entity type="Comment">
        <Text>При каждом сообщении WS: MarketDataService.onCandleUpdate(candle)</Text>
        <Location left="936" top="779" />
        <Size width="241" height="50" />
      </Entity>
      <Entity type="Comment">
        <Text>Если это та же свеча → currentSeries.updateLastCandle(candle)</Text>
        <Location left="1239" top="725" />
        <Size width="217" height="50" />
      </Entity>
      <Entity type="Comment">
        <Text>Если свеча закрылась → currentSeries.addCandle(candle)</Text>
        <Location left="1239" top="837" />
        <Size width="217" height="50" />
      </Entity>
      <Entity type="Comment">
        <Text>Уведомление UI: candleUpdated/ candleClosed</Text>
        <Location left="1547" top="779" />
        <Size width="190" height="50" />
      </Entity>
      <Entity type="Comment">
        <Text>UI получает данные только через уведомления MarketDataService</Text>
        <Location left="46" top="109" />
        <Size width="122" height="76" />
      </Entity>
      <Entity type="Comment">
        <Text>MarketDataService проверяет: есть ли currentSeries
если нет → ошибка / игнор</Text>
        <Location left="471" top="779" />
        <Size width="200" height="64" />
      </Entity>
    </Entities>
